'''Kroxo '''(ワーニック, ''Wānikku'') is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] variant of [[Croco]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Kroxo
|image = E 168.png
|first appearance = '''ItF''': [[Machu Picchu (Into the Future)|Chapter 1 - Machu Picchu]]<br>
'''SoL''': [[Gestalt, Decay|Sub-chapter 27 - Gestalt, Decay]]<br>
'''CotC''': [[Jupiter (Cats of the Cosmos)|Chapter 1 - Jupiter]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Tower of the Time Lord|Sub-chapter 21 - Tower of the Time Lord]]
|money drop = 130¢ - 513¢
}}

==Enemy==
Although he appears to be one of the weakest Aliens and is not much of a threat in Into the Future, later in the game his DPS skyrockets to 12k~25k due to the absurdly high strength magnifications he's given in [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]].

==Strategy==
The strategy for this enemy varies greatly with his strength magnification. [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Sexy Legs Cat]] works great against low-strength Kroxos, but his damage becomes apparent in late-game, requiring units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] to get rid of him in time. [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] can nuke groups of them with his massive area damage to aliens. [[:Category:Surge Attack Cats|Surge Attackers]] like [[Brainwashed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Brainwashed Sexy Legs Cat]] are also amazing at dealing with hordes of Kroxos.

