==Trivia==
*His Japanese name, Wānikku (ワーニック) is nearly the same as [[Croco]]'s (ワニック), but with a ー (''[[wikipedia:Chōonpu|chōonpu]]'') added after the "wa".
**"Wanikku" is a portmanteau of 鰐 ''wani'' ("crocodile") and パニック ''panikku'' ("panic"), referencing [[wikipedia:Gator Panic|''Gator Panic'']]'s Japanese name, Waniwani Panic (ワニワニパニック ''Waniwani Panikku'').
*He is the only character to have a semicolon in his description.

